          "id": 3443975055,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Should this be done in epan/dissectors/packet-zabbix.c as well? It does add the tvbuff as a child, but that way, there'd be fewer calls to `tvb_uncompress_zlib()` to check. (It's also used in epan/dissectors/packet-woww.c.)",
